{"unit_id":"S-AN-Shu__dsh-progress-narrator#card-zh","repo":"S-AN-Shu/dsh-progress-narrator","commit":"c68c7b347e3ba3a4bba66f7257966a38a1e8649d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-progress-narrator 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的进度播报与过程显示插件。它在既有模型请求边界加入播报规则和适时提醒，并通过 DSH Connection 提供状态与设置接口。主要功能包括根据静默时长或步骤生成进度提醒、将公开进度行与普通正文分段展示、折叠较早的思考和工具过程，以及调整播报频率、样式和显示选项。适合需要跟踪长时间 DSH 会话进展的用户。需要兼容的 DSH 0.2 profile；代码未要求额外 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1-30","lib/state.js:1-20","lib/client.js:1-10"]}
{"unit_id":"S-AN-Shu__dsh-progress-narrator#card-en","repo":"S-AN-Shu/dsh-progress-narrator","commit":"c68c7b347e3ba3a4bba66f7257966a38a1e8649d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-progress-narrator adds progress updates and process controls to DSH Web. It inserts guidance during requests, tracks session activity, separates progress lines, and folds earlier reasoning and tool output. Timing and style are configurable in DSH settings. Requires a compatible DSH 0.2 profile.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1-30","lib/state.js:1-20","lib/client.js:1-10"]}
